'''Nymph Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|Version 9.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]] grants higher health and a chance to [[Knockback]] [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

