==Trivia==
*Nymph Cat and its various forms are based on the well known fable of the [[wikipedia:The Honest Woodcutter|honest woodcutter]]. What remains consistent across its many variations is that a woodcutter lost his axe in water, then a mystical entity surfaces, holding a golden and silver axe, which he denies ownership of. When he is offered his own axe, he claims it, and was additionally given the other two axes as a reward for his honesty. Later on, less scrupulous individuals attempt the same thing, but lie, thus receiving nothing. The specific version referenced by this unit and her Japanese description involves a Nymph presenting both the valuable axes at once.

